  "bodyHash": "972ece997987167d",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">IRON FURNACES<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yWGgGVF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"232\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>受 cpw 的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-chests\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Chests</a> 模组启发，本模组添加了若干不同等级的熔炉。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aTsri2PvSis?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>通过无与伦比的冶炼速度、可重新配置的侧面、用于烟熏和 blast 的增强组件以及更多功能，最大化冶炼效率。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>你能合成彩虹熔炉并解锁它的力量吗？</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/237664/description_09f9eaf4-c6c9-46bf-8ab3-de8890723606.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"283\" height=\"267\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>有问题？请阅读 <a href=\"https://github.com/Qelifern/IronFurnaces/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">版本状态</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>NeoForge 26.x.x：活跃开发中</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Forge：未处于开发状态</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Fabric：未处于开发状态</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>旧版 Fabric：</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-furnaces-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Furnaces [FABRIC]</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Iron Furnaces 应与大多数模组兼容。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>它与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/project-mmo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Project MMO</a> 具有显式兼容性。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>推荐资源包：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Iron Furnaces Framed: [<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/iron-furnaces-bordered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curseforge</a>/<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252firon-furnaces-framed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>] By <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fEnleey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enleey</a><br>Shamble's Iron Furnaces: [<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fshables-iron-furnaces\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a>] by <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fShable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shamble</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">其中使用的 Thermal Series 纹理已获得 CoFH 的许可。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>更新日志</strong><strong>:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Qelifern/IronFurnacesNeoForge/blob/4.4.2/ifchangelog.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Qelifern/IronFurnacesNeoForge/blob/4.4.2/ifchangelog.txt</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">本模组为开源项目，采用 Apache License, Version 2.0 许可证授权。在遵守许可证条款的前提下，可对其进行修改并在任何项目中使用。</h3>",
